# Higgsfield for PillPal

When the user asks to generate, create, or design images, screenshots, App Store previews, posters, or videos, use the **Higgsfield MCP** tools (`generate_image`, `generate_video`, `media_upload`, `media_confirm`). Do not fall back to Gemini, Composio, or the built-in image tool unless Higgsfield is unavailable.

## App Store previews

- Aspect ratio: `9:16` (iPhone)
- Style: mint cream background, white rounded cards, PillPal branding
- Save files under `AppStorePreviews/`
- Prefer real product screenshots as references when the user provides them

## Auth

If Higgsfield tools fail with auth/connection errors, tell the user to open **Cursor Settings → Tools & MCP**, enable **higgsfield**, and complete the OAuth sign-in in the browser.
